Founder Scout:
LOW / MEDIUM signal

Startup Scout:
MEDIUM signal

Reason:
Useful collection of startups, but relatively downstream,
broader than Berkeley students, and many companies are already
formalized / accelerated / fundraising.

Do not treat SkyDeck participation as strong founder evidence by itself.

Versus:

Web Development at Berkeley

Founder Scout:
HIGH signal

Startup Scout:
LOW / MEDIUM signal

Reason:
Direct access to Berkeley students who repeatedly design,
build, and ship real products.

Useful for identifying builders before they necessarily
describe themselves as founders.
