Because Founder Scout wants to detect:

who is building
who repeatedly ships
who other strong builders choose to work with
who is unusually technically capable
who is starting projects before incorporation

A downstream accelerator may only reveal someone after:

company formed
team formed
funding raised
accelerator accepted company
demo day occurred

At that point much of the sourcing advantage is gone.

